<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-16T22:24:02.706Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:24:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces continue advancing in Tigray while militia attacks near the Ethiopia-Kenya border have killed civilians and displaced thousands, raising refugee numbers in Kenya above 50,000. Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Ethiopia accuses Eritrea of directing a Tigray rebel offensive with Egyptian support, and Eritrean forces have carried out drone and artillery strikes near Badme. The army chief has labeled Eritrea a vector of chaos and accused Egypt of backing the TPLF. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5VUzBzZDdGOTFaZDRVZUdGRVpobjd6UUxsTnZOWFRuZVVCSEtvcUIxdnR6SU9xb3JQYlVFR3dmbDVuYVoyVld3VG1aYmpfZU5SSUN0dzgzQV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9IaW4tSVlfYzdOZmxKLUoyR25fVldUVVNpME4zNUxTb1NOR1o1bTF4QmtpQjRyOHQ0TjlyQnZPdG5xNVNCWDRRcGtUNllKN2V6eDJldVR5UVgxc0lxSFlia0Q1QzQ0dVHSAVxBVV95cUxPeTFFajNWeTJpM2NSSFk4bFhNNXJjVmFtRFo2WkJkbWplbTNtYkctd3hSa3NNRE5Wb3VhdXJQamdPVS1iMWhXaC1MUWhoWnhaZHc0WDh2WmoxUzBNMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http